{"id":"horizonte","lemma":"horizonte","pos":"noun","rank":4323,"glosses":["horizon (line that appears to separate Earth from the sky)"],"ipa":"/o.ɾiˈzõ.t͡ʃi/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/39/Pt-horizonte.ogg/Pt-horizonte.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"horizontes"},"examples":[{"text":"A paz está no horizonte.","en":"Peace is on the horizon.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"peace"},{"g":"is","l":"estar"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"O sol apareceu no horizonte.","en":"The sun appeared on the horizon.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"sun"},{"g":"to appear","l":"aparecer"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"A lua estava acima do horizonte.","en":"The moon was above the horizon.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"moonlight, moonshine"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"on top"},{"g":"of the"},null]},{"text":"Filmes bons expandem nossos horizontes.","en":"Good movies expand our horizons.","words":[{"g":"film","l":"filme"},{"g":"desirable","l":"bom"},{"g":"to expand","l":"expandir"},{"g":"our kin"},null]},{"text":"Viajar nos amplia os horizontes.","en":"Travel broadens one's horizons.","words":[{"g":"to travel"},{"g":"us","l":"nós"},{"g":"to enlarge, magnify","l":"ampliar"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}